        ==================  =======
        Argument            Outputs
        ==================  =======
        ``openblock``       ``{%``
        ``closeblock``      ``%}``
        ``openvariable``    ``{{``
        ``closevariable``   ``}}``
        ``openbrace``       ``{``
        ``closebrace``      ``}``
        ``opencomment``     ``{#``
        ``closecomment``    ``#}``
        ==================  =======
